        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment (believed to come from the tomb of a daughter of Pepin the Short in the Church of St. Ursula, Cologne). Weft twill. Warp: light neutral colored silk. Weft: reddish purple and light neutral colored silk. Design: all-over pattern with gryphon on the back of a bull framed in circles, woven with reddish purple on a light neutral colored ground.."@en ;
